<title>ROMANIA: Romania Astra reports half-year loss.</title>
<headline>Romania Astra reports half-year loss.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>						    (in billion lei)</p>
<p> Loss		     9.67	vs	  7.44</p>
<p> Turnover		24.10	vs	  9.82</p>
<p> Total assets	 222.85	vs	 251.64</p>
<p> Debts		  142.07	vs	 159.01</p>
<p> Share capital	 85.97</p>
<p>NOTE - Astra-Vagoane SA is a listed state-run railway carriage maker. Figures, reported according to Romanian accounting standards, were taken from its report to the Bucharest bourse.</p>
<p>($=3,161 lei) -- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
